<section class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/img/photos/roofer-ladder.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-ladder-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer-ladder.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="901" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>Services</nav><span class="kicker on-dark">What we handle</span><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services Across Vermont</h1><p class="lede">Twelve services, one job: an accurate, defensible value for your loss. Start with an estimate review, bring us in once appraisal is demanded, or ask us to serve as a neutral umpire.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn light" href="/claim-review-request/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards" data-stagger><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/appraisal-clause-representation/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/business-document.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/business-document-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/business-document.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 01</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/appraisal-clause-representation/">Appraisal Clause Representation</a></h2><p>We serve as your named appraiser once the appraisal clause is invoked, from inspection through signed award.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/appraisal-clause-representation/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/homeowner-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/victorian-snow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/victorian-snow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/victorian-snow.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="807" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 02</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/homeowner-claim-appraisal/">Homeowner Claim Appraisal</a></h2><p>Independent valuation for houses, camps and condos when the carrier’s estimate falls short of the real repair.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/homeowner-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/commercial-hoa-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 03</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/commercial-hoa-claim-appraisal/">Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</a></h2><p>Appraisal for inns, shops, farms, churches, multifamily buildings and condo associations with disputed property losses.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/commercial-hoa-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/roof-and-hail-damage-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-aerial.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 04</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/roof-and-hail-damage-appraisal/">Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</a></h2><p>Measured roof scopes for hail, wind and snow damage: slopes, pitch, underlayment, flashing and matching.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/roof-and-hail-damage-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/wind-and-microburst-damage-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/windstorm-trees.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/windstorm-trees-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/windstorm-trees.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 05</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/wind-and-microburst-damage-appraisal/">Wind &amp; Microburst Damage Appraisal</a></h2><p>Valuation for straight-line wind, microburst and rare tornado losses, from lifted shingles to structural repair.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/wind-and-microburst-damage-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/tropical-storm-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-flood-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 06</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/tropical-storm-claim-appraisal/">Tropical Storm Claim Appraisal</a></h2><p>Help after the remnants of tropical systems bring wind and rain inland, as Irene and Beryl did.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/tropical-storm-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/water-damage-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/framing-pipes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/framing-pipes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/framing-pipes.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 07</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/water-damage-claim-appraisal/">Water Damage Claim Appraisal</a></h2><p>Burst pipes, failed fittings, sudden leaks and wind-driven rain: scopes that include drying, demolition and rebuild.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/water-damage-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/fire-and-smoke-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fire-ladder.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fire-ladder-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fire-ladder.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 08</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/fire-and-smoke-claim-appraisal/">Fire &amp; Smoke Claim Appraisal</a></h2><p>Structure fires, chimney fires and smoke losses, including soot cleaning, odor control and contents.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/fire-and-smoke-claim-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/ice-dam-and-frozen-pipe-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles-gutter.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-gutter-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles-gutter.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="815" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 09</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/ice-dam-and-frozen-pipe-appraisal/">Ice Dam &amp; Frozen Pipe Appraisal</a></h2><p>Vermont’s signature winter claims: meltwater backing up under shingles and pipes that split in a cold snap.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/ice-dam-and-frozen-pipe-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/snow-load-collapse-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/white-barn-snow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/white-barn-snow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/white-barn-snow.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="793" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 10</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/snow-load-collapse-appraisal/">Snow Load &amp; Collapse Appraisal</a></h2><p>Roof and structural collapse from heavy snow and ice, from sagging rafters to failed barn roofs.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/snow-load-collapse-appraisal/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/insurance-estimate-review/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-notebook.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-notebook-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-notebook.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 11</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/insurance-estimate-review/">Insurance Estimate Review</a></h2><p>A line-by-line read of the carrier’s estimate against your property, before you decide on appraisal.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/insurance-estimate-review/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article><article class="card rv "><a class="ph" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/umpire-services/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/team-meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/team-meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/team-meeting.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="badge">Service 12</span></a><div class="in"><h2><a href="/vt-claim-appraisal/umpire-services/">Umpire Services</a></h2><p>Neutral umpire service for appraisal panels that cannot agree on the amount of loss.</p><a class="more" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/umpire-services/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">View service →</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="sec mist"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><span class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</span><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what the gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn" href="/vt-claim-appraisal/insurance-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one step?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and farm claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes: inns, shops, multifamily buildings, condo associations, churches, barns and other farm structures.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle flood claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>We value covered damage. Flood from rising water is usually a separate policy with its own rules; we will explain how that affects your claim.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Is the carrier’s number short of the repair?</h2><p>Send us the estimate. We will read it line by line and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn light" href="/claim-review-request/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
</main>
